---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import bankData from '../../data/rbi-bank-rates.json';
---
<BaseLayout title="MSME Interest Calculator (Beta)" description="Estimate invoice-wise delayed-payment interest using verified user-entered RBI bank-rate periods." eligible={false} searchType="Legal tool" breadcrumbs={[{name:'Home',path:'/'},{name:'Legal Tools',path:'/tools/'},{name:'MSME Interest Calculator',path:'/tools/msme-interest-calculator/'}]}>
<nav class="breadcrumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span><a href="/tools/">Legal Tools</a><span>/</span><span aria-current="page">MSME Interest Calculator</span></nav>
<header class="article-header"><p class="kicker">Legal tools · Beta</p><h1>MSME Interest Calculator</h1><p class="intro">Invoice-wise estimates for eligible invoices, including dated payments and explicit payment allocations. Enter verified acceptance dates and choose recorded RBI bank rates or manual rate periods.</p></header>
<form id="msme-form" hidden>
<section class="rr-tool-panel"><h2>Calculation date</h2><div class="rr-tool-fields"><label>As of (interest end date excluded)<input name="asOf" type="date" required min="2006-10-02" max="2200-12-31"/></label></div></section>
<section class="rr-tool-panel msme-section"><h2>Invoices</h2><p>Use established acceptance or deemed acceptance, not automatically the invoice date. Enter the original eligible invoice amount and each payment allocated to that invoice. Do not enter a net balance and then deduct payments again.</p><div id="invoice-list"></div><button type="button" class="rr-tool-secondary" id="add-invoice">+ Add invoice</button></section>
<section class="rr-tool-panel msme-section"><h2>Historical RBI bank rates</h2><div class="rr-tool-fields"><label>Bank-rate mode<select name="rateMode" id="rate-mode"><option value="auto">Automatic — RBI source-based beta history</option><option value="manual">Manual — enter verified rate periods</option></select></label></div><p class="notice" id="rate-coverage">Recorded coverage: {bankData.coverageStart} through {bankData.verifiedThrough}. No future extrapolation. Data is source-transcribed; independent editorial verification pending. <a href="/tools/rbi-bank-rates/">View complete rate history and sources</a>.</p><div id="manual-rates" hidden><p>Enter contiguous verified rate periods covering the default period. Enter the bank rate itself, not the repo rate or the tripled rate. <a href="https://data.rbi.org.in/">RBI data portal</a> · <a href="https://www.rbi.org.in/scripts/FS_Notification.aspx">RBI notifications</a>.</p><div id="rate-list"></div><button type="button" class="rr-tool-secondary" id="add-rate">+ Add rate period</button></div></section>
<section class="rr-tool-panel msme-section"><label><input type="checkbox" required/> I have verified the inputs and understand this beta is an estimate using monthly anniversary rests and actual/365, not a certified claim calculation. Payment allocations and compounding on unpaid capitalized interest are my selected assumptions, not a legal determination.</label><div class="rr-tool-actions"><button class="rr-button" type="submit">Calculate estimate</button></div></section>
</form>
<noscript><p>Enable JavaScript to calculate.</p></noscript>
<p id="msme-status" role="status">Enter calculation details.</p>
<section id="msme-result" class="rr-tool-panel msme-section" hidden><h2>Invoice-wise interest estimate</h2><p class="rr-tool-result-label">Estimated total</p><p id="msme-total" class="rr-tool-total"></p><dl class="rr-tool-breakdown"><dt>Original invoice principal</dt><dd id="msme-original"></dd><dt>Principal paid</dt><dd id="msme-principal-paid"></dd><dt>Outstanding principal</dt><dd id="msme-principal"></dd><dt>Total interest accrued</dt><dd id="msme-earned"></dd><dt>Interest paid</dt><dd id="msme-interest-paid"></dd><dt>Outstanding estimated interest</dt><dd id="msme-interest"></dd></dl><p id="msme-date"></p><div class="msme-table-wrap"><table class="msme-table"><thead><tr><th>Invoice</th><th>Acceptance</th><th>Due date</th><th>Default date</th><th>Days</th><th>Original principal</th><th>Principal paid</th><th>Principal left</th><th>Interest paid</th><th>Interest left</th><th>Total</th></tr></thead><tbody id="msme-rows"></tbody></table></div><h3>Payment allocations</h3><div class="msme-table-wrap"><table class="msme-table"><thead><tr><th>Invoice</th><th>Date</th><th>Payment</th><th>Allocation rule</th><th>Principal paid</th><th>Interest paid</th></tr></thead><tbody id="msme-payments-result"></tbody></table></div><h3>Entered rate periods</h3><ul id="msme-rates"></ul><p class="notice">Selected payment allocations only; accrued interest is paid before capitalized interest within the interest component. Actual/365, monthly anniversary rests, exclusive interest end date, user-verified rates. Not certified.</p><div class="rr-tool-actions"><button type="button" class="rr-tool-secondary" id="msme-csv">Download calculation CSV (Excel-compatible)</button><button type="button" class="rr-tool-secondary" id="msme-print">Print / Save PDF</button></div></section>
<section class="home-section prose"><h2>2026 statutory amendment — verification notice</h2><p>The MSMED (Amendment) Act, 2026 (Act 16 of 2026) has phased commencement. The calculator remains a legacy Sections 15–16 research estimate; it does not determine the effect of amendments, savings, revised dispute procedure or enforceability. Check the official Act and commencement notifications before relying on the result. See <a href="https://www.gazettetracker.com/g/CG-DL-E-12102026-277080">the indexed reproduction of S.O. 5575(E)</a> as a discovery reference, not an authenticated Gazette copy.</p><h2>Calculation method and limitations</h2><p><a href="https://www.indiacode.nic.in/bitstream/123456789/5872/1/a2006-27.pdf">MSMED Act, 2006 — Sections 2(b), 15–17</a>. Without written terms the due date is acceptance plus 15 days; with written terms use the agreed period of up to 45 days. Interest begins the following day. The calculator rejects longer terms instead of silently capping them.</p><p>Interest accrues at three times each entered RBI bank rate. The model uses daily actual/365 accrual on principal plus previously capitalized interest, posting interest at monthly anniversaries of default (clamped in shorter months). Rate changes split accrual intervals without creating extra rests. The calculation date is excluded. No intermediate rounding.</p><p>These day-count and rest-calendar conventions are assumptions, not a statutory determination. Supplier eligibility, registration, disputed acceptance, lawful appropriation and limitation are not determined. Each payment is applied at the beginning of its date, after any monthly posting for the preceding interval. Same-day payments follow the entered order. Interest-only and principal-only payments cannot exceed the selected balance. Interest-first and principal-first allocate any remainder to the other balance. Within interest, unposted accrual is paid first, then capitalized interest. Capitalized interest continues to accrue under this model even if principal is fully paid. Verify whether that is legally appropriate in your case. Payments on the calculation date are included, but interest for that date is excluded. Automatic mode uses the dated source-transcribed rate history with an explicit coverage cutoff; manual rates remain available. Use the output only after independent review. Inputs stay in the browser.</p></section>
<template id="invoice-template"><fieldset class="msme-entry"><legend>Invoice</legend><div class="rr-tool-fields"><label>Reference<input data-field="id" required maxlength="80"/></label><label>Original eligible principal (₹)<input data-field="amount" type="number" min="0.01" max="1000000000000" step="0.01" required/></label><label>Acceptance / deemed acceptance<input data-field="acceptance" type="date" required min="2006-10-02" max="2200-12-31"/></label><label>Written payment period (days; leave blank if none)<input data-field="terms" type="number" min="0" max="45" step="1"/></label></div><div class="msme-payment-list"></div><div class="rr-tool-actions"><button type="button" class="rr-tool-secondary" data-add-payment>+ Add payment</button><button type="button" class="rr-tool-secondary" data-remove>Remove invoice</button></div></fieldset></template>
<template id="payment-template"><fieldset class="msme-entry"><legend>Payment</legend><div class="rr-tool-fields"><label>Payment date<input data-payment="date" type="date" required min="2006-10-02" max="2200-12-31"/></label><label>Payment amount (₹)<input data-payment="amount" type="number" required min="0.01" max="1000000000000" step="0.01"/></label><label>Allocation method<select data-payment="mode" required><option value="">Select verified allocation</option><option value="principal-only">Principal only</option><option value="interest-only">Interest only</option><option value="principal-first">Principal first, remainder interest</option><option value="interest-first">Interest first, remainder principal</option></select></label></div><button type="button" class="rr-tool-secondary" data-remove-payment>Remove payment</button></fieldset></template>
<template id="rate-template"><fieldset class="msme-entry"><legend>Rate period</legend><div class="rr-tool-fields"><label>Effective from (inclusive)<input data-field="from" type="date" required/></label><label>Until (exclusive)<input data-field="to" type="date" required/></label><label>RBI bank rate (%)<input data-field="rate" type="number" min="0" max="30" step="0.0001" required/></label><label>RBI source reference<input data-field="source" required maxlength="250"/></label></div><button type="button" class="rr-tool-secondary" data-remove>Remove rate</button></fieldset></template>
</BaseLayout>
<script>
 import {msmeEstimate,msmeDueDate} from '../../lib/msme-interest.mjs';
 import bankData from '../../data/rbi-bank-rates.json';
 import {msmeCsv} from '../../lib/msme-export.mjs';
 import {historicalRatePeriods} from '../../lib/rbi-rates.mjs';
 const el=(id:string)=>document.getElementById(id)!;
 const form=el('msme-form') as HTMLFormElement,result=el('msme-result'),status=el('msme-status'),invoices=el('invoice-list'),rates=el('rate-list');
 const money=new Intl.NumberFormat('en-IN',{style:'currency',currency:'INR',minimumFractionDigits:2,maximumFractionDigits:2});
 const val=(row:Element,key:string)=>(row.querySelector('[data-field="'+key+'"]') as HTMLInputElement).value;
 let serial=0,report:string|null=null;
 function invalidate(){report=null;result.hidden=true;status.textContent='Details changed. Calculate again.'}
 function add(list:HTMLElement,template:string,limit:number){if(list.children.length>=limit)return;const row=(el(template) as HTMLTemplateElement).content.firstElementChild!.cloneNode(true) as HTMLElement;list.append(row);if(list===invoices)(row.querySelector('[data-field="id"]') as HTMLInputElement).value='Invoice '+(++serial);row.querySelector('[data-remove]')!.addEventListener('click',()=>{row.remove();invalidate()});if(list===invoices){const payments=row.querySelector('.msme-payment-list')!;row.querySelector('[data-add-payment]')!.addEventListener('click',()=>{if(payments.children.length>=200)return;const item=(el('payment-template') as HTMLTemplateElement).content.firstElementChild!.cloneNode(true) as HTMLElement;payments.append(item);item.querySelector('[data-remove-payment]')!.addEventListener('click',()=>{item.remove();invalidate()});invalidate()})}invalidate()}
 const parts=new Intl.DateTimeFormat('en-CA',{timeZone:'Asia/Kolkata',year:'numeric',month:'2-digit',day:'2-digit'}).formatToParts(new Date());
 (form.elements.namedItem('asOf') as HTMLInputElement).value=['year','month','day'].map(t=>parts.find(p=>p.type===t)?.value).join('-');
 el('add-invoice').addEventListener('click',()=>add(invoices,'invoice-template',100));
 el('add-rate').addEventListener('click',()=>add(rates,'rate-template',200));
 add(invoices,'invoice-template',100);add(rates,'rate-template',200);form.hidden=false;form.addEventListener('input',invalidate);
 const mode=el('rate-mode') as HTMLSelectElement;
 function syncMode(){const manual=mode.value==='manual';el('manual-rates').hidden=!manual;for(const input of rates.querySelectorAll<HTMLInputElement>('input'))input.disabled=!manual;invalidate()}
 mode.addEventListener('change',syncMode);syncMode();
 form.addEventListener('submit',e=>{e.preventDefault();invalidate();try{
  const inv=Array.from(invoices.children).map(row=>({id:val(row,'id'),amount:Number(val(row,'amount')),acceptance:val(row,'acceptance'),terms:val(row,'terms')===''?null:Number(val(row,'terms')),payments:Array.from(row.querySelectorAll('.msme-payment-list > fieldset')).map(p=>({date:(p.querySelector('[data-payment="date"]') as HTMLInputElement).value,amount:Number((p.querySelector('[data-payment="amount"]') as HTMLInputElement).value),mode:(p.querySelector('[data-payment="mode"]') as HTMLSelectElement).value}))}));
  const asOf=String(new FormData(form).get('asOf'));
  if(!inv.length)throw new Error('Enter at least one invoice.');
  const earliest=inv.map(i=>msmeDueDate(i.acceptance,i.terms).defaultDate).sort()[0];
  const rate=mode.value==='auto'?(earliest<asOf?historicalRatePeriods(bankData,earliest,asOf):[]):Array.from(rates.children).map(row=>({from:val(row,'from'),to:val(row,'to'),rate:Number(val(row,'rate')),source:val(row,'source')}));
  const r=msmeEstimate(inv,rate,asOf);
  report=msmeCsv(r,rate,mode.value==='auto'?'RBI dataset '+bankData.version:'Manual rates');
  el('msme-original').textContent=money.format(r.totals.original);el('msme-principal-paid').textContent=money.format(r.totals.principalPaid);el('msme-earned').textContent=money.format(r.totals.interestEarned);el('msme-interest-paid').textContent=money.format(r.totals.interestPaid);
  el('msme-total').textContent=money.format(r.totals.total);el('msme-principal').textContent=money.format(r.totals.principal);el('msme-interest').textContent=money.format(r.totals.interest);el('msme-date').textContent='As of '+r.asOf+' (exclusive) · '+(mode.value==='auto'?'RBI source-based history '+bankData.version:'Manual rate periods');
  const body=el('msme-rows');body.replaceChildren();
  for(const row of r.rows){const tr=document.createElement('tr');for(const x of [row.id,row.acceptance,row.due,row.defaultDate,String(row.days),money.format(row.amount),money.format(row.principalPaid),money.format(row.principal),money.format(row.interestPaid),money.format(row.interest),money.format(row.total)]){const td=document.createElement('td');td.textContent=x;tr.append(td)}body.append(tr)}
  const paymentBody=el('msme-payments-result');paymentBody.replaceChildren();for(const row of r.rows){for(const p of row.allocations){const tr=document.createElement('tr');for(const x of [row.id,p.date,money.format(p.amount),p.mode,money.format(p.principal),money.format(p.interest)]){const td=document.createElement('td');td.textContent=x;tr.append(td)}paymentBody.append(tr)}}
  const list=el('msme-rates');list.replaceChildren();for(const p of rate){const li=document.createElement('li');li.textContent=p.from+' to '+p.to+' (exclusive): '+p.rate+'% bank rate — '+p.source;list.append(li)}
  result.hidden=false;status.textContent='Estimate complete. Review assumptions.';
 }catch(error){status.textContent=error instanceof Error?error.message:'Calculation failed.'}});
 el('msme-csv').addEventListener('click',()=>{if(!report||result.hidden)return;const url=URL.createObjectURL(new Blob([report],{type:'text/csv;charset=utf-8'}));const a=document.createElement('a');a.href=url;a.download='rule-and-ratio-msme-estimate.csv';a.click();setTimeout(()=>URL.revokeObjectURL(url),1000)});
 el('msme-print').addEventListener('click',()=>{if(!result.hidden)window.print()});
</script>
